# CP1 script — drives the presentation, the menu and the demonstration.
# Format: one key token per line ('#' starts a comment); see tests/selftest.keys.
#   ESC  skips the intro (asm/0688 polls ESC and jumps to the title at asm/0242)
#   D    demonstration: the story poem, asm/03AC
#   WAIT "the player thought about it": lets each couplet finish its hold, so
#        six of them run the whole poem
#   X    not a choice: asm/03A6 redraws the title
#   P    play: poem, then the CP4 stub
#   ESC  ends that demonstration
#   C    create: the CP3 stub
#   (end of script = end of input; the flow returns and the engine exits 0)
ESC
D
WAIT
WAIT
WAIT
WAIT
WAIT
WAIT
X
P
ESC
C
